      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Exercise is a potent stimulus to asthma. The diagnosis is not always straightforward, and health care providers should have a high index of suspicion. Treatment usually controls exercise-induced asthma but usually requires therapy tailored for each individual patient."},
